the initial abundance files in each case are actually

- initial_comp_sun.dat - the solar abundances from Asplund et al. (2009)
 
These are scaled down to the metallicity.

- initial_comp_alphaenhanced.dat

Also, solar abundances but with an enhancement of [alpha/Fe] = +0.4 
to the alpha isotopes (e.g., o16, ne20, mg24, si28 etc).

These are then scaled down to the metallicity in question.

